rust-roformer
Copyright 2026 the rust-roformer authors (the Rust code in this repository)

This product bundles no model weights and no audio samples. It runs third-party
Mel-Band RoFormer checkpoints that you download yourself.

Upstream work whose graphs/weights this code can run, and whose architecture it
re-implements:
  - Mel-Band RoFormer architecture: ZFTurbo, MIT, arXiv:2310.01809
  - vocals checkpoint: KimberleyJSN/melbandroformer (card tag: MIT)
  - ONNX export: smank/mel-band-roformer-vocals-onnx (card tag: MIT)
  - baseline comparison used while validating: mixxxdj/demucs (MIT)
Each of those carries its own license terms for the *weights*. Training-data
provenance for the vocals checkpoint is not stated on any of those cards, which
is disclosed in docs/LICENSES.md rather than resolved by the MIT tags above.
